  Description: "COMPANION / COMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nA basic hit schedules a poison
    strike after 1s for 25% of this ally's weapon damage. The target and source must
    still be alive. Poison cannot create another poison chain.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE
    OWNED\nTeam / Knockback: +2.5%\nChampion / Maximum health: -1\nTier 1/2/3 traits
    \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING
    REALM\nA performer who hid criticism inside jokes until the court learned to
    applaud without listening. They left mid-punchline. They want to speak one plain
    truth and be heard without laughter covering it.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nOwn weapon
    damage gains 0.5% per companion body in the roster, before later balance modifiers.\r\n\nNamed
    talents count bodies and absorbed memories; their stated percentages are not
    multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated. Listed support modifiers scale
    separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: orchard, mask. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment;
    two equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless the talent forbids it."
